{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:51 2026-10-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:51 2026-10-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:51 2026-10-17 HKT</p><img alt=\"伊波拉疫情傳至肯亞。 美聯社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2abfb4ffe94f98a354080dbc00b12388/2026-10/AP26280382243949.jpeg\"/><p>伊波拉疫情傳至肯亞。肯亞衛生部確認新增4宗病例，令當地累計確診個案增至7例。其中1例死亡。</p><p>截至10月16日，肯亞官方僅累計3宗確診，首例輸入個案死亡，第2例是其39 歲家屬，第3例也是隔離者之一。</p><p>10月17日，肯亞衛生部公布新增4宗確診。4名患者在接受病毒檢測呈陽性反應前，均已出現發燒（fever）等臨床症狀 。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T14:59:12.446157+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":242,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:51:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T18:17:38.136692+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T14:57:36.626020+00:00","content_hash":"ca944c1b7953e73c102681ce894241cf441adb5fc5d4f4850dbdcde63a4b6636","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}